    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A journey through death, accompanied by flowers and melodies.&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a spiritual embalmer in this realm between the living and the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the gravestones by typing the names of the deceased on computer keyboards. Unravel their past stories and settle their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing is the main interaction, move with WASD and mouse for rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~20mins experience. Interactive graves are marked with colorful flower petals.\u00a0The rest are only for reading. The graveyard can shift between three worlds: the living, the between, and the dead. Players can puzzle up the deceased's stories across these worlds, and bring a meaningful item to their graves as an act of mourning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a solo production from 2022 to 2024 \u2014 models, animations, UI, scripting, etc. by me (Xiao), with no assets used. Music and sounds were made by friends Esko and Ali ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooted in my fear of losing a loved one. I wish death were no longer something to fear, and merely a process to appreciate that lives were here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The things that will be engraved on our gravestones are the ones we should cherish now.<br> <br>\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The instruction part is still a bit shaky; I will try to fix it next year. Before that, there is an interaction walkthrough video attached in the manual, enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first part of a series of graveyard games and is therefore free. The later ones will explore different cultural backgrounds and mourning practices.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A journey through death, accompanied by flowers and melodies.&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a spiritual embalmer in this realm between the living and the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the gravestones by typing the names of the deceased on computer keyboards. Unravel their past stories and settle their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing is the main interaction, move with WASD and mouse for rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~20mins experience. Interactive graves are marked with colorful flower petals.\u00a0The rest are only for reading. The graveyard can shift between three worlds: the living, the between, and the dead. Players can puzzle up the deceased's stories across these worlds, and bring a meaningful item to their graves as an act of mourning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a solo production from 2022 to 2024 \u2014 models, animations, UI, scripting, etc. by me (Xiao), with no assets used. Music and sounds were made by friends Esko and Ali ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooted in my fear of losing a loved one. I wish death were no longer something to fear, and merely a process to appreciate that lives were here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The things that will be engraved on our gravestones are the ones we should cherish now.<br> <br>\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The instruction part is still a bit shaky; I will try to fix it next year. Before that, there is an interaction walkthrough video attached in the manual, enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first part of a series of graveyard games and is therefore free. The later ones will explore different cultural backgrounds and mourning practices.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;May you leave no regrets in this journey of life.&quot; \u3001 An independent game about death. Explore the past lives in an atmospheric graveyard.",
